WEBVTT

00:02.070 --> 00:10.240
I never knew that liking someone would be this painful.

00:14.860 --> 00:15.840
I like you.

00:24.490 --> 00:25.860
Me too...

00:28.090 --> 00:32.010
Tsuwabuki-kun... I like you.

00:54.150 --> 01:00.870
Shining stars away bless

01:01.200 --> 01:06.080
chiisakutonaeru mahou no kotobawa

01:01.200 --> 01:06.080
Silently chanting the magical words

01:06.960 --> 01:08.710
『onegai。。。』

01:06.960 --> 01:08.710
"please"

01:09.000 --> 01:14.340
hoshizora samayou kaze ni notta maigo notsubu

01:09.000 --> 01:14.340
The lost grain riding the wind on the sky

01:14.340 --> 01:15.380
『kizuite。。。』

01:14.340 --> 01:15.380
Please notice

01:15.380 --> 01:23.270
tsutawara nakute porori ochita kono omoi

01:15.380 --> 01:23.270
Untold words, teardrops of feelings that fell down

01:23.770 --> 01:30.360
kagayaki dasuyo GARASU bin nonaka

01:23.770 --> 01:30.360
Show your shine inside the glass bottle

01:30.730 --> 01:37.740
manten no hoshi deatta KISEKI kimi ga soba ni itekureru nara

01:30.730 --> 01:37.740
If you will stay beside me perfect star of encountered miracles...

01:37.910 --> 01:45.120
Whatever the mystery, I will be able to gather my courage.

01:38.320 --> 01:45.120
donna fushigi mouke tomeru yuuki umare te yuku yo

01:45.450 --> 01:52.710
nanatsuiro ni hikaru houseki sora kara mai oriru

01:45.450 --> 01:52.710
Seven colored glittering gems flying down from the sky

01:52.710 --> 01:56.420
Scoop up the important fragments

01:53.130 --> 01:56.420
daijina KAKERA sukui agerune

01:56.420 --> 02:01.930
kowasa nuyou sotto。。。

01:56.420 --> 02:01.930
And secretly hold onto them tight

02:09.470 --> 02:14.980
<i>The truth is, life has gotten complicated since that day.  </i>

02:20.660 --> 02:21.620
Good morning.

02:22.710 --> 02:24.390
G-Good morning.

02:29.250 --> 02:31.690
Aha ha, what happened after that?

02:34.740 --> 02:37.080
They're at it so early in the morning?

02:37.090 --> 02:39.230
What a difficult couple.

02:52.080 --> 02:54.690
Jeez, making us work so hard.

02:54.860 --> 02:58.450
Hey you two, how long has it been now?

02:58.460 --> 03:02.150
Both of them are red like cherries.

03:02.950 --> 03:06.730
If it has gone this far, then maybe...

03:06.730 --> 03:07.660
Yes, exactly.

03:16.550 --> 03:20.470
Blissful Colored Wings

03:16.550 --> 03:20.470
Blissful Colored Wings

03:30.160 --> 03:33.140
<i>To think that she is Karin-sama's daughter...</i>

03:35.610 --> 03:38.710
Miss, you sure are full of enthusiasm.

03:46.130 --> 03:48.530
You don't have to work so hard, Miss.

03:48.530 --> 03:52.670
As you are an excellent Stellar Spinear, Miss.

04:01.870 --> 04:05.560
Ehhh?! You two haven't even been on a date?

04:06.600 --> 04:10.020
Sumomo-chan, you don't want to have a date?

04:10.890 --> 04:13.050
Of course she wants to!

04:13.060 --> 04:14.570
You want to, right?

04:16.290 --> 04:19.170
Uoooh! So irritating!

04:19.690 --> 04:22.790
Sumomo-chan, it's time to use this!

04:23.670 --> 04:25.900
My cell phone?

04:25.910 --> 04:27.640
W-When did she take that...

04:28.440 --> 04:30.420
Why don't you invite him instead, Sumomo-chan?

04:33.620 --> 04:35.430
Me invite him?

04:37.440 --> 04:39.800
Miss...

04:43.690 --> 04:45.050
Dinner is served.

04:51.140 --> 04:53.960
Miss, the sun has already set.

05:00.070 --> 05:03.500
How about dinner? Maybe taking it in the dining room would be better...

05:05.820 --> 05:11.860
Miss, that's bad for your health!

05:25.320 --> 05:28.560
I wonder if Tsuwabuki-kun is busy.

05:28.570 --> 05:30.470
He hasn't replied yet.

05:31.350 --> 05:35.270
<i>Oh crap, I haven't checked my cell phone today. </i>

05:38.040 --> 05:40.270
Well, there is still time before Sunday.

05:43.540 --> 05:48.830
<i>I wonder if you have to hold hands during dates.</i>

05:53.100 --> 05:58.120
<i>Tsuwabuki-kun's hand must be really big.</i>

05:58.960 --> 06:02.050
<i>After holding hands, next will be...</i>

06:05.540 --> 06:08.250
<i>Next will be getting closer...</i>

06:09.750 --> 06:16.470
<i>Stare into Tsuwabuki-kun's eyes while trying not to be nervous. </i>

06:17.070 --> 06:18.270
<i>And then...</i>

06:28.980 --> 06:31.170
S-Sumomo?

06:41.030 --> 06:42.650
See you later, Sumomo.

06:42.660 --> 06:43.380
Good night.

06:45.330 --> 06:46.440
Yuki-chan!

06:51.980 --> 06:55.220
I can do it if it's Yuki-chan.

06:57.180 --> 06:58.550
Good night.

07:01.680 --> 07:02.980
Safe landing.

07:10.710 --> 07:12.360
It's from Sumomo.

07:12.370 --> 07:17.220
"Let's meet at Hoshinomori Park this coming Sunday at ten."

07:17.220 --> 07:19.080
I see, so that's what it is.

07:19.080 --> 07:20.510
The next mail is...

07:26.100 --> 07:27.760
It's the same mail...

07:30.540 --> 07:33.220
<i>Akihime must be feeling nervous too.</i>

07:39.240 --> 07:42.230
T-Tsuwabuki-kun!

07:44.330 --> 07:45.440
I'm sorry.

07:48.310 --> 07:50.440
I got lost on the way...

07:51.780 --> 07:54.680
F-First time here?

07:54.660 --> 07:58.920
No, but I still got lost...

07:58.920 --> 08:00.160
I see.

08:02.140 --> 08:03.730
Errr...

08:08.450 --> 08:09.820
Good morning!

08:16.210 --> 08:17.200
Shall we go?

08:41.100 --> 08:44.770
<i>This is not good... I need to say something.</i>

08:44.770 --> 08:47.150
<i>What should I talk about?</i>

08:48.270 --> 08:49.690
<i>Ah, that's right!</i>

08:49.690 --> 08:51.360
A-Akihime...

08:53.630 --> 08:55.990
Uh, err... Akihime?

09:09.920 --> 09:11.650
Ah, look, a swan boat!

09:16.040 --> 09:18.030
Oh no!

09:24.540 --> 09:25.800
Are you alright?

09:28.280 --> 09:30.570
Thank you for the help.

09:32.890 --> 09:35.540
Ah, you're bleeding!

09:36.900 --> 09:38.180
H-Here.

09:39.070 --> 09:40.300
Thanks.

09:44.790 --> 09:46.660
Guess I'll use it later.

09:51.230 --> 09:53.650
Wah, it's so pretty.

09:54.730 --> 09:56.190
Over there too!

10:00.140 --> 10:01.570
Pretty...

10:07.500 --> 10:09.310
It's the Bell of Hope!

10:09.790 --> 10:11.030
Huh?

10:20.020 --> 10:23.260
When the bell rings while a couple is together...

10:23.430 --> 10:24.700
Umm...

10:25.540 --> 10:28.230
the couple's future will be connected.

10:30.260 --> 10:34.800
T-Things like that are kind of embarrassing or...

10:35.880 --> 10:39.560
How should I say this... umm...

10:42.510 --> 10:44.330
I guess you're right.

11:10.280 --> 11:13.140
Oh it's from Fukamichi-san.

11:16.730 --> 11:18.900
Kissed?

11:22.420 --> 11:24.250
Did you two kiss?

11:24.260 --> 11:28.620
L-L-Like I would!

11:29.890 --> 11:33.070
You went on a date, but didn't do it?

11:33.070 --> 11:36.850
Sumomo-chan, that was your first date right?

11:36.990 --> 11:40.120
Do you kiss on your first date?

11:41.000 --> 11:41.630
Do you?

11:44.790 --> 11:46.970
W-Why are you asking me?!

11:47.120 --> 11:50.630
That's because Nobuko-san has a lot of experience.

11:50.640 --> 11:51.790
W-Well, that's...

11:54.330 --> 11:56.000
Catch!

11:56.000 --> 11:58.820
You! You did only that?

11:58.820 --> 12:00.540
Listen to me! Hey!

12:00.540 --> 12:01.270
Shut up!

12:01.270 --> 12:04.350
A man should do this and that, all the good things!

12:04.350 --> 12:04.990
What are you doing?!

12:29.480 --> 12:31.420
Ahh... I give up...

12:32.530 --> 12:35.990
Looks like we got bombarded with questions all day long.

12:35.990 --> 12:37.410
Looks like it.

12:44.710 --> 12:48.640
Lately, this place has become the most calming place.

12:52.790 --> 12:55.270
It has sprouted now! Wow!

12:56.530 --> 13:00.800
The seed we planted last time, right here.

13:02.850 --> 13:03.680
Ah!

13:03.690 --> 13:04.540
Right?

13:04.650 --> 13:05.850
Yeah.

13:09.500 --> 13:10.760
It really is.

14:03.950 --> 14:08.940
First time with this kind of feeling.

14:12.200 --> 14:13.240
Yuki-chan!

14:13.240 --> 14:13.870
Sumomo!

14:15.700 --> 14:19.580
Somehow, it's different than usual.

14:19.590 --> 14:20.600
What do you mean?

14:20.610 --> 14:24.300
I don't know but it feels like something good is going to happen.

14:25.650 --> 14:28.000
Let's go, Yuki-chan!

14:37.090 --> 14:39.480
That must be it, Yuki-chan.

14:39.480 --> 14:40.680
Yes.

14:42.160 --> 14:44.400
I've been waiting for you, Prima Plam.

14:52.770 --> 14:54.490
Aspalas-san...

14:54.490 --> 14:56.620
It's just Aspalas.

14:56.730 --> 15:01.050
I've given up trying to correct you on that.

15:01.050 --> 15:06.630
Prima Plam, tonight will be the time to put each of our Stellar Spinear's pride on the line for a serious match!

15:07.670 --> 15:13.640
<i>Aspalas-san... if that is what you wish for...</i>

15:15.090 --> 15:16.800
Do you see that?

15:19.700 --> 15:23.510
That will be the star drop that we will compete to capture.

15:24.660 --> 15:28.750
This star drop's movement is on another level compared with the others before.

15:28.750 --> 15:29.360
Yes.

15:29.360 --> 15:34.010
<i>A high level star drop appeared, just perfect for the match today.</i>

15:38.180 --> 15:41.100
Paris Aqua Hominis!

15:47.240 --> 15:49.440
She's walking on the water!

15:51.030 --> 15:53.340
Arthur! Are the preparations ready?

15:54.040 --> 15:55.600
Yes, Miss!

15:56.810 --> 15:58.430
Hear that? Let's begin.

15:59.960 --> 16:02.180
What should we do, Sumomo?

16:02.180 --> 16:03.990
Watch me, Yuki-chan.

16:03.990 --> 16:05.310
I'll do my best.

16:05.790 --> 16:07.180
Sumomo.

16:07.220 --> 16:08.650
It'll be alright.

16:17.460 --> 16:21.870
W-What speed it has... alright.

16:23.150 --> 16:25.820
Ruuche Ruvi Avis!

16:31.990 --> 16:34.180
Puruvi Radius!

16:46.440 --> 16:48.320
Ah, so close!

16:56.700 --> 16:57.910
So strong...

16:58.760 --> 16:59.870
But...!

17:03.000 --> 17:06.850
She is using Rimu Comiti Aqua, just as expected.

17:06.860 --> 17:08.630
I'll see if you can catch it.

17:20.960 --> 17:23.290
I see! It's alright!

17:23.300 --> 17:27.350
It looks like it's moving fast, but underwater it's moving much slower.

17:27.360 --> 17:31.290
And thanks to the Recipe, you can move underwater too.

17:33.490 --> 17:36.640
Sumomo, if you try hard enough, we can catch it if it's underwater.

17:36.650 --> 17:37.850
I'm certain.

17:38.460 --> 17:39.670
I'll do my best!

17:44.790 --> 17:46.640
Puruvu Radi!

17:50.750 --> 17:51.900
Yes!

17:54.030 --> 17:55.570
I-It disappeared!

17:57.180 --> 17:58.600
What was that just now?

17:58.610 --> 18:01.350
That's the first time I've seen a star drop disappear like that.

18:03.070 --> 18:05.400
Where is the star drop?

18:08.350 --> 18:09.740
I can't do it!

18:09.860 --> 18:13.210
Even if you catch it in your Ladle, it will just disappear.

18:17.380 --> 18:22.280
Looks like its speed decreases when it tries to move out of the water.

18:22.280 --> 18:23.730
Can you target it?

18:23.730 --> 18:25.020
I'll try.

18:32.340 --> 18:33.150
Sumomo!

18:36.430 --> 18:37.220
You!

18:37.210 --> 18:38.820
Paradivu Mei!

18:39.980 --> 18:43.160
I guess we can only wait till it comes underwater again.

18:43.160 --> 18:47.310
Maybe I should have tried flying a little bit further just now.

18:47.310 --> 18:48.970
Flying further?

18:48.980 --> 18:52.180
Note: "Kyan" in this case is an onomatopoeia similar to "swish" or "woosh" in English.

18:48.980 --> 18:52.180
We'll try to fly further, "kyan" like that.

18:54.010 --> 18:55.220
Sumomo?

18:56.190 --> 19:00.010
I feel like I'm filling with energy.

19:00.560 --> 19:04.710
Yuki-chan, I think I can do that Recipe Aspalas-san uses too.

19:04.710 --> 19:05.990
Which one?

19:05.990 --> 19:07.870
Just watch, Yuki-chan!

19:11.020 --> 19:13.260
Paradivu Mei

19:27.740 --> 19:29.760
Yay, yay!

19:29.770 --> 19:31.210
I got wings, wings!

19:31.210 --> 19:33.170
Yuki-chan, I'm flying!

19:33.170 --> 19:34.540
Y-Yeah.

19:34.540 --> 19:36.490
Sumomo, do you feel scared?

19:36.490 --> 19:38.960
I'm alright, I'm not scared at all.

19:39.770 --> 19:40.680
Wait!

19:43.810 --> 19:45.620
Puruvu Radi!

19:46.240 --> 19:47.680
Yes!

19:47.680 --> 19:49.290
You did it, Sumomo!

19:52.760 --> 19:55.040
She's flying without using the Ladle...

19:59.590 --> 20:01.590
That's the fourth one, right, Sumomo?

20:01.590 --> 20:02.480
Yes.

20:02.480 --> 20:04.150
Get a hold of yourself, Miss!

20:04.770 --> 20:06.360
Ah, so close!

20:07.010 --> 20:09.580
Aspalas-san... that is...?

20:10.210 --> 20:11.630
A star drop!

20:11.630 --> 20:13.980
I see. So there were two of them.

20:13.980 --> 20:17.180
It was moving around so fast so it looked like it was only one.

20:18.240 --> 20:19.070
But...

20:21.490 --> 20:24.500
Yuki-chan, that one is much faster.

20:24.500 --> 20:27.760
Yeah, even though we can fly, that thing is...

20:27.760 --> 20:30.120
But we need to do something, or...

20:34.850 --> 20:44.200
Rimu Forna Mei. A very powerful spell, but making a mistake in using it will be... dangerous?!

20:44.760 --> 20:47.610
W-What should we do, Sumomo?

20:51.100 --> 20:55.650
<i>That girl, suddenly learning new flying magic without practicing...</i>

20:55.650 --> 20:59.240
<i>And on top of that a type of flying magic using shining wings instead of the Ladle.</i>

21:00.590 --> 21:02.130
I will not give this one to you!

21:02.940 --> 21:04.560
Puruvi Radiu-

21:10.400 --> 21:11.440
W-What is that?

21:14.770 --> 21:17.690
Rimu Forna Mei!

21:19.500 --> 21:21.500
This Recipe... It can't be!

21:21.500 --> 21:23.510
You must be kidding! This is...

21:37.100 --> 21:39.020
This is so mysterious right, Yuki-chan.

21:39.030 --> 21:40.650
The star drop is moving much slower now.

21:44.650 --> 21:45.840
Sumomo!

21:46.780 --> 21:48.660
Puruvu Radi!

21:48.950 --> 21:50.090
Yes!

21:50.100 --> 21:52.020
That's great, Sumomo!

21:56.810 --> 21:59.680
This will make it five!

22:06.190 --> 22:08.900
T-This can't be...

22:13.030 --> 22:17.060
Right now, I feel like I can do anything!

22:18.960 --> 22:22.990
I feel really really excited, Yuki-chan.

22:22.990 --> 22:23.780
Yeah!

22:26.390 --> 22:31.400
<i>That night was the best thing happening for both me and Sumomo.</i>

22:31.400 --> 22:37.470
<i>That's why we never imagined anything really sad occurring after that.</i>

22:51.540 --> 22:55.090
kira kira no hoshikuzu ha maru de

22:51.540 --> 22:55.090
Fragments of glittering stars

22:55.090 --> 22:58.380
koi suru otome no kiseki

22:55.090 --> 22:58.380
are just like the miracles of a girl in love

22:58.630 --> 23:02.180
kinou mada no watashi ha doko he

22:58.630 --> 23:02.180
Where did the cleverness from yesterday go,

23:02.180 --> 23:05.100
nanika chigau RABIRINSU

23:02.180 --> 23:05.100
Since it's like a labyrinth now

23:05.600 --> 23:09.350
dan dan wakan naku naru

23:05.600 --> 23:09.350
Slowly becoming confused

23:09.520 --> 23:12.360
（doushi you　doushi you）

23:09.520 --> 23:12.360
What do I do? What do I do?

23:12.610 --> 23:19.570
don don afurete kuru　AH　HAHAHA

23:12.610 --> 23:19.570
Slowly becoming overflowed

23:19.740 --> 23:25.450
yume no naka jya　nandemo ieru no ni…

23:19.740 --> 23:25.450
But inside a dream, can't you say anything?

23:25.450 --> 23:29.080
yuuki kudasai

23:25.450 --> 23:29.080
Please give me courage

23:30.370 --> 23:32.000
mo-o！

23:30.370 --> 23:32.000
Mo-o!

23:32.170 --> 23:36.840
konna ni aitai no ni

23:32.170 --> 23:36.840
I really want to meet you

23:36.840 --> 23:39.130
kanari Bi-myo

23:36.840 --> 23:39.130
Proxy doll

23:39.300 --> 23:43.050
toki meki ga koi no saidai no teki

23:39.300 --> 23:43.050
This throbbing is love's biggest challenge

23:43.050 --> 23:44.640
jirettai no yo

23:43.050 --> 23:44.640
It's irritating

23:44.640 --> 23:45.970
ne-e

23:44.640 --> 23:45.970
Isn't it?

23:46.390 --> 23:51.100
yume kara sametara mata

23:46.390 --> 23:51.100
The reasons to wake again

23:51.100 --> 23:56.650
kobore souna kimi no egao ni

23:51.100 --> 23:56.650
Are overflowing to see your smile

23:56.650 --> 23:59.570
airu kana

23:56.650 --> 23:59.570
If we meet again

24:10.240 --> 24:12.390
A man keeps a secret and keeps on living...

24:10.720 --> 24:12.380
Next Episode

24:12.390 --> 24:13.490
Keisuke's ten-yen!

24:13.490 --> 24:14.250
Don't say that!

24:14.250 --> 24:16.300
Flora-chan's three sizes!

24:16.300 --> 24:17.150
Hey!

24:17.150 --> 24:18.310
Yayoi's happening...

24:18.310 --> 24:19.210
Ehhh?!

24:19.210 --> 24:20.590
Haru has one too.

24:20.600 --> 24:22.550
Looks like Sumomo is going to know about it?

24:21.600 --> 24:24.900
Episode 9

24:21.600 --> 24:24.900
Sand Beige Colored Sadness

24:22.560 --> 24:24.890
What are you going to do, Haru?
